SUMMARY:Alabama: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:20th of month following the reporting period (quarterly filers 
 use the same day-of-month rule). | Q1 2026 (Jan-Mar) sales tax return\, app
 lying Alabama's quarterly-filer due-date rule: 20th of month following the 
 reporting period (quarterly filers use the same day-of-month rule). This is
  a representative recurring pattern\, not a single annual deadline - actual
  filing frequency (monthly/quarterly/annual) is assigned per business by th
 e state. | Authority: Direct fetch of Alabama's own tax agency site this se
 ssion | Source: https://www.revenue.alabama.gov/sales-use/sales-tax/ | This
  date is computed from a recurrence rule and may not reflect a later-announ
 ced change\; confirm against the cited source before relying on it.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
