SUMMARY:North Carolina: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:20th of the following month\; quarterly filers due the last day
  of Jan/Apr/Jul/Oct for the preceding 3-month period. | Q1 2026 (Jan-Mar) s
 ales tax return\, applying North Carolina's quarterly-filer due-date rule: 
 20th of the following month\; quarterly filers due the last day of Jan/Apr/
 Jul/Oct for the preceding 3-month period. This is a representative recurrin
 g pattern\, not a single annual deadline - actual filing frequency (monthly
 /quarterly/annual) is assigned per business by the state. | Authority: Dire
 ct fetch of North Carolina's own tax agency site this session | Source: htt
 ps://www.ncdor.gov/taxes-forms/sales-and-use-tax/sales-and-use-tax-filing-r
