SUMMARY:Tennessee: State sales & use tax return due
DESCRIPTION:20th of month following the reporting period\; quarterly due 20
 th of month following quarter end\, annual filers due January 20. | Q1 2026
  (Jan-Mar) sales tax return\, applying Tennessee's quarterly-filer due-date
  rule: 20th of month following the reporting period\; quarterly due 20th of
  month following quarter end\, annual filers due January 20. This is a repr
 esentative recurring pattern\, not a single annual deadline - actual filing
  frequency (monthly/quarterly/annual) is assigned per business by the state
 . | Authority: Direct fetch of Tennessee's own tax agency site this session
  | Source: https://revenue.support.tn.gov/hc/en-us/articles/360058589911-SU
